title: "Learnable ants: Coordination without convergence (code and data)"
abstract: >-
  Simulation platform, per-seed results and figures for the study
  "Coordination without convergence: Three decouplings in learnable ant
  collectives", in which colonies of small transformer agents coordinate
  only through a pheromone medium.
